      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.35,
      "end_seconds": 295.65,
      "duration_seconds": 12.3,
      "text": "You can sit up now. So where does that leave us? I'd lean towards seasonal hay fever causing the cough. I'd also keep early asthma in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 301.42,
      "end_seconds": 304.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "do you think it's something serious?"
