      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.62,
      "end_seconds": 330.83,
      "duration_seconds": 25.21,
      "text": "nothing I've seen today points to an emergency it looks like seasonal hay fever causing the cough i'm gonna put you on fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, once a day, for the season it's for hay fever keep windows closed on high-pollen days and wash your hair at night do get help quickly if you start wheezing"
    },
